From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ozark-Proton <ozark-proton@localhost>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 10:55:00 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] ntdll: fail cleanly when a mapped image has no readable NT header.

An image section that NtMapViewOfSection maps successfully can still have
unreadable NT headers in the fresh view. RtlImageNtHeader returns NULL then,
and both loader paths below deref it: page fault on read of FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF
inside load_native_dll.

Observed with Bodycam (UE5, appid 2406770): its game-folder nvngx.dll is
mapped, RtlImageNtHeader fails, and find_existing_module crashed instead of
failing the load.

Two guards, both defensive:

- find_existing_module: keep the get_modref() fast path first, so a module
  that is already registered is still returned when its header is unreadable
  in this view, then read the header once and return NULL if absent. Guarding
  before get_modref would have rejected an already-loaded module.
- convert_to_pe64: check the header before deriving the section table and the
  copy sizes from it. The former code initialized those from nt at declaration
  time, so the 32/64-bit check that follows could never run on a NULL header.

Scope: defensive only. Why this file's headers read as invalid in-game is
still unknown; that needs a follow-up, not these guards.

diff --git a/dlls/ntdll/loader.c b/dlls/ntdll/loader.c
index 52b6e70585c..ca513d2891b 100644
--- a/dlls/ntdll/loader.c
+++ b/dlls/ntdll/loader.c
@@ -2507,12 +2507,16 @@ static BOOL convert_to_pe64( HMODULE module, const SECTION_IMAGE_INFORMATION *in
     IMAGE_OPTIONAL_HEADER32 hdr32 = { IMAGE_NT_OPTIONAL_HDR32_MAGIC };
     IMAGE_OPTIONAL_HEADER64 hdr64 = { IMAGE_NT_OPTIONAL_HDR64_MAGIC };
     IMAGE_NT_HEADERS *nt = RtlImageNtHeader( module );
-    IMAGE_SECTION_HEADER *sec = IMAGE_FIRST_SECTION( nt );
-    SIZE_T hdr_size = min( sizeof(hdr32), nt->FileHeader.SizeOfOptionalHeader );
-    SIZE_T size = min( nt->OptionalHeader.SizeOfHeaders, nt->OptionalHeader.SizeOfImage );
+    IMAGE_SECTION_HEADER *sec;
+    SIZE_T hdr_size, size;
     void *addr = module;
     ULONG i, old_prot;
 
+    if (!nt) return FALSE;  /* unreadable header: cannot convert, fail the load */
+    sec = IMAGE_FIRST_SECTION( nt );
+    hdr_size = min( sizeof(hdr32), nt->FileHeader.SizeOfOptionalHeader );
+    size = min( nt->OptionalHeader.SizeOfHeaders, nt->OptionalHeader.SizeOfImage );
+
     if (nt->OptionalHeader.Magic != IMAGE_NT_OPTIONAL_HDR32_MAGIC) return TRUE;  /* already 64-bit */
     if (NtCurrentTeb()->WowTebOffset) return TRUE;  /* no need to convert */
     if (!info->ImageContainsCode) return TRUE;  /* no need to convert */
@@ -2922,9 +2926,10 @@ static WINE_MODREF *find_existing_module( HMODULE module )
     WINE_MODREF *wm;
     LIST_ENTRY *mark, *entry;
     LDR_DATA_TABLE_ENTRY *mod;
-    IMAGE_NT_HEADERS *nt = RtlImageNtHeader( module );
+    IMAGE_NT_HEADERS *nt;
 
     if ((wm = get_modref( module ))) return wm;
+    if (!(nt = RtlImageNtHeader( module ))) return NULL;
 
     mark = &NtCurrentTeb()->Peb->LdrData->InMemoryOrderModuleList;
     for (entry = mark->Flink; entry != mark; entry = entry->Flink)
